	(text "Vout = 0.6 * (1 + Rtop/Rbot)\n0.85 = 0.6 * (1 + Rtop / 100k)\nRtop = 41.67k\n42.2k -> 0.8532v\n43.2k -> 0.8592v\nTrim slightly high to ensure SW > LDO default voltage over tolerance"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 72.644 84.328 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
